h; custom strategy callbacks are the\nfuture route.\n- **presentCall/presentR"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"esult not customized**: indicator results have no file /\nterminal / diff semantics; UI falls back to"},{"id":"p33s6","text":" generic cards.\n- **Market tools need network**: live cases live in verify.ts; offline indicator /\nb"},{"id":"p33s7","text":"acktest cases are unaffected."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### Compatibility contributors"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Thanks to **@hufeide** for the DSH 0.2.x adaptation in #136, and **@ziladan** for requesting 0.2.1-r"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"c.2 verification in #139 / #140. The compatibility audit records tested versions and release boundar"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"verification in #139 / #140. The compatibility audit records tested versions and release boundaries."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["summary_length"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
